<h1>Elianne Bahena</h1>
<p>22nd Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Running for the open seat with the endorsement of retiring Ald. Michael Rodriguez, and would be the ward&#39;s first alderwoman. She says she wants a City Council that gets things done for working-class residents by being willing to speak with everyone. No campaign website or detailed platform found yet.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Chief of staff to Ald. Michael Rodriguez; elected member of the 10th Police District Council; vice president of the 22nd Ward Independent Political Organization and a board member of Mujeres Latinas en Acción. Little Village resident and daughter of immigrants.</p>
